{"unit_id":"zdjmrq__dsh-pluginmanager#card-zh","repo":"zdjmrq/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"f7806d87b84930062d899075c71537fe0e71719d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pluginmanager 是 DSH Web 的插件管理器，在设置中的插件页面加入分层管理界面。它通过 Web 设置插槽呈现系统、WebUI、工具、用户扩展和临时运行插件清单，并结合 Loader 与 profile 配置显示插件状态。用户可以搜索插件、编辑显示名称和描述、补登记依赖、启用或停用用户扩展，也可以卸载用户扩展；启停会更新补丁配置并尝试即时切换运行状态。适合需要整理和维护 DSH Web 插件的用户。运行依赖 DSH Web 的 profile 与本地文件访问，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:738-745","lib/index.js:934-1007","lib/index.js:1018-1098","lib/index.js:1103-1200"]}
{"unit_id":"zdjmrq__dsh-pluginmanager#card-en","repo":"zdjmrq/dsh-pluginmanager","commit":"f7806d87b84930062d899075c71537fe0e71719d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pluginmanager adds a layered plugin manager to DSH Web Settings, listing plugins from profile configuration and live Loader state. Users can search, edit descriptions, register dependencies, and toggle or uninstall user extensions. It helps maintain a DSH Web profile and needs no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:738-745","lib/index.js:934-1007","lib/index.js:1018-1098","lib/index.js:1103-1200"]}
